# Accounting: Depreciation calculator (simplified)

Load examples/accounting/data/asset_record.txt as Asset Record

Find cost basis and save as cost_basis
Find land value and save as land_value
Find months in service and save as months_in_service

cost_basis equals 0 if cost_basis == nil
land_value equals 0 if land_value == nil
months_in_service equals 12 if months_in_service == nil

depreciable_basis equals cost_basis minus land_value
recovery_period equals 27.5
annual_depreciation equals depreciable_basis / recovery_period
partial_year_depreciation equals annual_depreciation * months_in_service / 12

land_value must be at least 1

Route partial_year_depreciation to accounting_depreciation_queue
